ty boundary, fronting Valley View Road.\n*   **Wastewater:** A circle symbol labeled **\"CLEAN-OUT\"** is located near the top-left (northwest) corner of the existing central **\"SLAB\"**.\n*   **Gas:** A rectangular symbol labeled **\"GAS METER\"** is located near the top (north) edge of the existing central **\"SLAB\"**. \n*   **HVAC:** An **\"A/C CONDENSER\"** is labeled adjacent to the top edge of the main building slab.\n*   **Utility Easements:** The plan delineates several public utility easements around the perimeter to accommodate infrastructure:\n    *   **\"5' P.U.E.\"** is noted running along the left property boundary (adjacent to Valley View Road).\n    *   **\"5' P.U.E.\"** is noted running along the right property boundary.\n    *   A **\"5' ELEC. EASEMENT\"** is shown running parallel to a portion of the top property boundary.\n    *   A utility easement (partially obscured but appears to read **\"5' P.U.E.\"** based on surrounding text context like Vol/Pg references) runs along the bottom property boundary.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1350,"outputTokens":652,"totalTokens":5903,"reasoningTokens":3901},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-