ed drainage, filtration and detention facilities were constructed in conformance with the approved plans:\n>     - Release of the Certificate of Occupancy by the Development Services Department (inside the City Limits);\n>       or\n>     - Installation of an electric or water meter (in the five mile ETJ).\"\n\n**Site Plan Release Notes:**\n> \"4. The owner is responsible for all costs of relocation of, or damage to, utilities.\"\n\n**Legend:**\nThe legend contains the following symbols and labels explicitly referencing electrical or utility items:\n*   `— PUE —` : **Public Utility Easement**\n*   *[Dashed rectangle symbol]* : **Electric Easement**\n*   *[Circle with an 'X' symbol]* : **Existing Power Pole & Down Guy**\n*   *[Square with an 'E' symbol]* : **Existing Electric Meter**\n*   `[ T ]` : **Existing Transformer Pad**\n*   `— OHE —` : **Existing Overhead Electric Line**\n*   `— OHE —` : **Overhead Electric Line**","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":47590.142343,"endTime":90548.108617,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"igH9aZHRM8SvsbwPwd7l-AE"}]}],"totalProvider