ys, or building entrances?\n\nPlease be specific about spatial relationships and any text visible on the drawing."}]}],"providerOptions":{"gateway":{"user":"b877dead-f786-4bf6-9ac4-3cde3f2ec546","tags":["label:VISION_CHECK_REVIEW_EL_MD_EXP_VAR1_RUN_1","tool:vision"]}},"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-NDtVrJ4gFPHWiHcUtoaq2g7o","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 07 May 2026 21:19:00 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"iad1::iad1::df7jb-1778188696558-ee164bbc34f3"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of Sheet 9 of the Valley View Townhomes site plan, here are the findings regarding your questions:\n\n**1. Are there any transformer pads, electrical equipment, or electrical callouts shown on this site plan?**\nYes. There is a transformer pad and various electrical utility lines and easements explicitly labeled on this sheet.\n\n**2. If transformers are shown, what are their locations relative to buildings (north/south/east/west of which buildings)?**\nThere is one labeled transformer pad on this sheet.\n*   **Label:*