eir proximity to each transformer pad. The electrical and site plans should show where these specific trees are positioned. I also notice the transformer pad dimensions aren't specified on the plans, so I should check if AE Design provides detail sheets for the pad specifications.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ee23800-1891-4c6c-9860-87ab169d6f67","uuid":"7844751c-bf4e-486e-8f06-7b2f52c0fdd2"}
