ument is explicitly labeled \"Sheet 28 of 35\". Sheet 35 is not included in this view.\n*   On this specific sheet (Sheet 28), there are **no cross-references** to a plant schedule on Sheet 35 that link specific locations to species. \n*   The terms \"Live Oak\", \"Cedar Elm\", \"Mexican Redbud\", and \"Texas Mountain Laurel\" do not appear anywhere in the text, notes, or labels on this page. \n*   All tree symbols are strictly labeled by their function/category (**ST**, **PL**, **P**, **M**) as defined in the key notes, rather than by species.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":1098070.530664,"endTime":1127081.301242,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"5gH9acGtDc_esbwPrOfWiAw"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.036663","marketCost":"0.036663","inferenceCost":"0.036438","inputInferenceCost":"0.002874","outputInferenceCost":"0.033564","reportingTagWriteCost":"0.000225","generationId":"gen_01KR24YTMRBQ0HWZ6BBG139FS8"}}}]},"msg":"Vision response"}
