e fire lane; **\"25'\"** is marked between the west side of Bldg 6 and the fire lane.\n*   **Setbacks:** A dashed perimeter line is labeled **\"25' Building Setback\"**.\n*   **Property Lines:** Boundary dimensions are provided, such as **\"S63° 02' 25\" E 419.96'\"** along the top property line.\n\n**6. Any callouts or notes related to electrical equipment clearances from fire features**\n*   A thorough review of the \"Notes\", \"Fire Zone Notes\", and other text blocks on the sheet reveals **no** callouts or notes specifically addressing electrical equipment clearances from fire hydrants or other fire features.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":1745804.087764,"endTime":1790226.808867,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"4wH9abn1LMaXsbwPkN3eeQ"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.063109","marketCost":"0.063109","inferenceCost":"0.062884","inputInferenceCost":"0.002872","outputInferenceCost":"0.060012","reportingTagWriteCost":"0.000225","generationId":"gen_01KR24YR7HRA7B552ERE0P067G"}}}]},"msg":"Vision response"}
