{"level":30,"time":1778188911288,"pid":123,"hostname":"082c71e6-af9","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR252MKBMK0H8E4X4ABVFAJ7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The landscape plan key notes don't mention electrical clearances. The tree symbols are:\n- SY - Street Yard Tree\n- PL - Parking Lot Tree\n- P - Parking Buffer Point Tree\n- M - Mitigation Tree\n\nThese symbols don't identify species, and there's no reference to electrical clearances or utility compatibility.\n\nNow let me compile my final findings. Based on all my research, here are the items that are FAIL or NOT-VERIFIABLE:\n\n**FAIL Items:**\n1. **EL-2.9** - Root barriers for trees within 20 ft of underground equipment not shown\n2. **EL-2.10** - Plant legend does not identify species (landscape plan symbols don't show which species)\n3. **EL-2.11** - Large trees not differentiated on plans\n4. **EL-2.14** - Trees not shown with sufficient clarity relative to overhead facilities to verify clearances\n5. **EL-2.15** - Trees proposed near transmission structures (western boundary) without documented Austin Energy approval (based on Sheet 3 requirements)\n\n**NOT-VERIFIABLE Items:**\n1. **EL-2.1** - Non-utility-compatible trees within 15 ft of distribution (cannot verify UC status)\n2. **EL-2.2** - Non-utility-compatible trees within 50 ft of transmission (cannot verify UC status or exact distances)\n3. **EL-2.3** - Large trees (40+ ft) within 25 ft of distribution (cannot verify mature heights per ECM Appendix F)\n4. **EL-2.4** - Large trees within 50 ft of transmission (cannot verify mature heights)\n5. **EL-2.6** - Trees within 10 ft of utility pole (cannot precisely measure)\n6. **EL-2.7** - Trees within 10 ft of pad-mounted equipment (cannot precisely measure)\n7. **EL-2.8** - Trees within 5 ft of underground equipment (cannot verify exact distances)\n\n\n8. **EL-2.12** - Clearances measured from conductor (N/A - no dimensions shown on plans)\n9. **EL-2.13** - Clearances measured from trunk (N/A - no dimensions shown on plans)\n\n**PASS/N/A Items:**\n- **EL-2.5** - Trees in transmission easement (no transmission easement on property per facts.md)\n- **EL-2.12** - Clearances measured from conductor (N/A - no dimensions shown, so methodology not applicable)\n- **EL-2.13** - Clearances measured from trunk (N/A - no dimensions shown, so methodology not applicable)\n\nActually, let me reconsider a few of these:\n\n**EL-2.12 & EL-2.13:** These deficiencies say \"Tree clearances measured from...\" This only applies IF clearances ARE measured/dimensioned on plans. Since none are shown, these don't apply. Should be PASS (no deficiency found because the requirement doesn't apply to this project's submission) or N/A.\n\n**EL-2.5:** No transmission easement on the property. Status should be N/A.\n\nActually, I need to be careful about what \"deficiency exists\" means for these items:\n\nFor **EL-2.12** and **EL-2.13**, the deficiency only exists IF clearances are dimensioned and measured incorrectly. If NO clearances are dimensioned, then the deficiency doesn't exist. Status: PASS\n\nFor **EL-2.5**, the deficiency only applies IF a transmission easement exists and trees are in it. No transmission easement exists on the property, so the deficiency is not applicable. Status: N/A\n\nNow, for **EL-2.14**, let me reconsider. The deficiency states: \"Trees not shown on landscape plan in relation to overhead electric\n\nThe key distinction is whether a deficiency can exist when the condition triggering it isn't present. For EL-2.12 and EL-2.13, since no clearances are dimensioned on the plans, there's no way the measurement methodology could be wrong—the deficiency simply doesn't manifest. For EL-2.5, without a transmission easement on the property, trees cannot be improperly positioned within one. EL-2.14 requires examining whether trees are adequately depicted relative to overhead electric lines on the landscape plan itself.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f00b2f4f-4bf8-4369-b6e1-683efc1760e1","uuid":"8ef10fce-f60f-4500-8cf3-9bcd06c37890"}
