{"level":30,"time":1778188920524,"pid":123,"hostname":"082c71e6-af9","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR252S35GD67RSD46T4Y8PSE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to provide the structured output with the proper schema. Let me identify which items are fail or not-verifiable based on my analysis.\n\nItems I've identified so far as problematic:\n1. EL-13.1 - Needs verification of actual clearance distances (appears to be 5-8 ft, may meet requirement)\n2. EL-13.10 - No access door orientation shown, cannot verify 10-foot hot-stick clearance\n3. EL-13.13 - Trees near pads not confirmed as utility-compatible\n4. EL-13.31 - No cross-section drawings provided showing vertical clearances\n5. EL-13.37 - No AE Design transformer pad detail sheets or specifications provided\n6. EL-13.38 - No bollard details or specifications provided\n7. EL-13.35 - Transformer easement widths not specified\n\nLet me analyze each item more systematically:\n\n**EL-13.1** - 5-foot clearance from buildings: Vision analysis shows 5-8 feet from buildings, which appears to meet the minimum 5-foot requirement. However, without precise dimensions on the plans, this is technically not-verifiable from the submitted documents.\n\n**EL-13.2** - 5-foot clearance from retaining walls: No retaining walls shown adjacent to transformer pads on the electrical plan.\n\n**EL-13.3** - Fence/gate clearances: No adjacent fences shown on plans.\n\n**EL-13.4** - Reduced 3-foot clearances with documentation: No reduced clearances are shown, so this doesn't apply.\n\n**EL-13.5** - 5-foot lateral clearance from balconies/overhangs: No overhangs shown above transformer pads.\n\n**EL-13.6** - 12-foot clearance from windows/doors when inadequate lateral separation: Need to check building elevations.\n\n\n**EL-13.7** - 2-foot from sidewalks: Sidewalk easement noted on plans, but distance not dimensioned. **EL-13.8** - Clearance from stairwells: No stairwells adjacent to transformer pads. **EL-13.9** - 20-foot clearance from fire escapes: No fire escapes shown adjacent. **EL-13.10** - 10-foot hot-stick clearance: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - No access door orientation indicated. **EL-13.11** - 15-foot clearance when facing confined space: No niches/confined spaces shown. **EL-13.12** - 5-foot from fire hydrants: No fire hydrants adjacent to transformer pads.\n\n**EL-13.13** - Trees within 10 feet must be utility-compatible: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Trees near TP1 (10-15 ft) and TP3 (5-10 ft) not positively identified; species not confirmed. **EL-13.14** - Shrub clearances: No shrubs dimensioned adjacent to transformer pads on plans. **EL-13.15** - Root barriers for trees within 20 feet: No root barrier details shown. **EL-13.16-20** - Various 5-foot clearances (dumpsters, bike racks, light poles, fire lanes, other transformer pads): No such features within 5 feet of transformer pads. **EL-13.21-23** - 5-foot clearance from water/wa\n\nUtility lines for wastewater and storm drainage appear on the plans but lack dimensional verification. Gas infrastructure similarly shown without specific measurements. The 12-inch clearance requirement from other utilities isn't dimensioned. Cross-installation coordination cannot be verified without detailed underground utility mapping. Overhead distribution lines don't appear to exist on this site, making the sky-to-ground and radius clearance requirements not applicable. Vertical clearance in ni size: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Transformer easement width not specified; per UCM, accessibility width determined by AE Design.\n\n**EL-13.36** - Electrical routing 100% on private property: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Routing depicted but lacks dimensioning to confirm private property boundaries.\n\n**EL-13.37** - Pad dimensions match AE Design details: **FAIL** - AE Design transformer pad detail sheets absent from submission; pad dimensions not indicated on plans.\n\n**EL-13.38** - Bollards within 4 feet of parking: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Bollard specifications and details missing; TP1 and TP5 proximity to parking areas unclear without explicit dimensioning.\n\n**EL-13.39** - No structures over/under overhead distribution facilities: **NOT-VERIFIABLE** - Overhead distribution facilities not identified on plans.\n\nMultiple items lack sufficient documentation: utility separations unspecified (EL-13.21-25), underground coordination not shown (EL-13.26), overhead lines not identified (EL-13.27-28), cross-sections absent (EL-13.31), equipment specifications incomplete (EL-13.32), and property/easement status unconfirmed (EL-13.33-36). Additionally, transformer pad access door orientation, tree species confirmation, and equipment grading details remain unverified due to missing plan dimensions and supporting documentation.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ee23800-1891-4c6c-9860-87ab169d6f67","uuid":"7e0e7788-2839-4844-bc0d-e8800f57ff2a"}
