{"level":30,"time":1778188927207,"pid":123,"hostname":"082c71e6-af9","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR25356DYZXKDJ7P510H7X0W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have completed the comprehensive site plan review for Grouping EL-13 (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements). \n\n## Summary\n\n**Grouping**: EL-13 — Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements  \n**Total Checklist Items**: 39\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n1. **Project Applicability**: Confirmed. The Valley View Townhomes project includes 4 transformer pads shown on the electrical design plan (Sheet 21). Transformer pad clearance requirements from UCM § 1.10.4 are applicable.\n\n2. **Critical Research Finding**: The Preliminary Electrical Design Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pad locations schematically but **lacks the specific dimensional evidence required to verify compliance**:\n   - No clearance dimensions from pads to buildings\n   - No detail reference callouts or pad specifications  \n   - No transformer pad dimensions documented\n   - No access door orientation identified\n   - No bollard/protective barrier details\n   - No grading/drainage direction shown relative to pads\n   - No cross-section drawings for vertical clearances\n   - No documentation of transformer type (oil-filled vs. dry)\n\n3. **Results**:\n   - **1 FAIL item** (EL-13.37): Transformer pad dimensions and AE Design-approved detail sheet references are completely absent\n   - **37 NOT-VERIFIABLE items**: Lack the dimensioned evidence needed to confirm compliance with specific clearance requirements\n   - **1 N/A item** (EL-13.16): No dumpsters on site, so requirement is inapplicable\n\nThe structured output has been provided above with detailed explanations for each finding, including specific observations from the vision analysis and the reasoning for each status determination."}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f2fc17a-22f3-4791-8627-5877b81951c5","uuid":"9582521b-56bc-41d3-b135-e12b1b79b60c"}
{"level":30,"time":1778188927267,"pid":123,"hostname":"082c71e6-af9","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":358240,"duration_api_ms":214355,"num_turns":28,"result":"I have completed the comprehensive site plan review for Grouping EL-13 (Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements). \n\n## Summary\n\n**Grouping**: EL-13 — Transformer Pad Clearances and Location Requirements  \n**Total Checklist Items**: 39\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n1. **Project Applicability**: Confirmed. The Valley View Townhomes project includes 4 transformer pads shown on the electrical design plan (Sheet 21). Transformer pad clearance requirements from UCM § 1.10.4 are applicable.\n\n2. **Critical Research Finding**: The Preliminary Electrical Design Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pad locations schematically but **lacks the specific dimensional evidence required to verify compliance**:\n   - No clearance dimensions from pads to buildings\n   - No detail reference callouts or pad specifications  \n   - No transformer pad dimensions documented\n   - No access door orientation identified\n   - No bollard/protective barrier details\n   - No grading/drainage direction shown relative to pads\n   - No cross-section drawings for vertical clearances\n   - No documentation of transformer type (oil-filled vs. dry)\n\n3. **Results**:\n   - **1 FAIL item** (EL-13.37): Transformer pad dimensions and AE Design-approved detail sheet references are completely absent\n   - **37 NOT-VERIFIABLE items**: Lack the dimensioned evidence needed to confirm compliance with specific clearance requirements\n   - **1 N/A item** (EL-13.16): No dumpsters on site, so requirement is inapplicable\n\nThe structured output has been provided above with detailed explanations for each finding, including specific observations from the vision analysis and the reasoning for each status determination.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7f2fc17a-22f3-4791-8627-5877b81951c5","total_cost_usd":0.36438315,"usage":{"input_tokens":14004,"cache_creation_input_tokens":132301,"cache_read_input_tokens":667629,"output_tokens":23648,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":132301},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":14004,"outputTokens":23648,"cacheReadInputTokens":667629,"cacheCreationInputTokens":132301,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.36438315,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"grouping":"13","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.1","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4","UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations on site (4 pads identified)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows four transformer pad locations but provides no dimension lines or callout notes showing clearance distances from any transformer pad to adjacent buildings. No detail references or specifications provided. Minimum 5-foot clearance requirement cannot be verified from submitted plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"The Preliminary Electrical Design Plan (Sheet 21) depicts four transformer pads via dashed rectangular outlines with leader lines labeled 'Electrical Transformer Pad.' Vision analysis confirmed no dimension lines, callout notes, or detail references appear near any of the four pad locations.","reasoning":"Although transformer pads are clearly located and labeled on Sheet 21, the absence of dimensional clearances from the pads to building walls prevents verification of compliance with the 5-foot minimum clearance requirement. The burden of proof is on the applicant to provide dimensioned drawings showing required clearances.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.4","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 2"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if reduced clearances are proposed)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions are shown on any sheets. Therefore, it cannot be determined whether reduced 3-foot clearances (to brick/masonry buildings) were proposed, or whether the conditions for the reduction exception (not in confined space, 10 ft+ to windows/doors/ducts, 15 ft+ vertical clearance, 3-hour fire rating) were met. If reduced clearances were intended, evidence of Austin Energy Design written approval is not present in submitted documentation.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision examination of Sheet 21 found no dimension lines indicating any clearance distances (whether standard 5 feet or reduced 3 feet) from transformer pads to buildings. No architectural fire rating specifications appear in the submitted plans.","reasoning":"This item is conditional on whether reduced clearances are proposed. Since no clearances of any magnitude are dimensioned on the plans, the applicability condition cannot be confirmed. Additionally, no Austin Energy Design written approval documentation for reduced clearances appears in the supplementary documents reviewed.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.5","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if balconies or overhangs are present above or adjacent)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"The site plan shows building footprints and transformer pad locations, but no vertical elevations or cross-sections are provided for the transformer pad areas showing whether balconies or building overhangs exist above or adjacent to any pad. Additionally, no dimension lines show clearance distances. Compliance cannot be verified from available evidence.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site Plan (Sheet 9) and Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) are plan-view drawings showing horizontal layout only. No building elevation sheets or cross-section details for transformer pad areas were located in the primary site plan sheets (1-39).","reasoning":"To verify this requirement, building elevations or cross-sections showing the vertical relationship between transformer pads and overhangs/balconies would be necessary. The absence of these drawings prevents assessment of whether overhangs exist and, if so, whether 5-foot lateral clearance is maintained.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if windows, doors, or ventilating ducts are present with inadequate separation)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No building elevation sheets showing window/door/duct locations relative to transformer pads were provided. No dimension lines show clearance distances from pads to windows, doors, or ventilating ducts. Specification of transformer equipment as oil-filled or dry-type was not provided. Compliance with the 12-foot horizontal clearance requirement for oil-filled equipment with inadequate lateral separation cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Site plan sheets are plan-view only and do not show window/door/duct elevations. No elevation drawings or architectural details depicting building façades near transformer pads were found in the plan set.","reasoning":"Assessment requires both elevation information (window/door/duct locations) and transformer specification (oil-filled vs. dry-type) and dimensional clearances, none of which are documented on the submitted sheets.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if sidewalks are adjacent to transformer pads)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan shows sidewalk locations and transformer pad locations, but no dimension lines measure the distance from transformer pad edges to back of sidewalks. The 2-foot minimum clearance requirement cannot be verified from dimensioned evidence.","agentTrace":{"observation":"The vision analysis of Sheet 21 confirmed no dimension lines appear between transformer pads and adjacent sidewalk edges.","reasoning":"Although sidewalks are shown near some transformer pad locations, the absence of dimensioned clearances prevents verification that the 2-foot minimum distance is maintained.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if fire escapes or stairs serving as fire escapes are present)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) shows no fire escapes or stairs serving as fire escapes. No such features appear on the buildings. Requirement to maintain 20-foot clearance from oil-filled equipment is not applicable as the triggering condition (fire escapes/stairs serving as fire exits) is not present.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision analysis of Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) confirmed no features labeled as fire escapes, emergency exit stairs, or structures designated as fire exits.","reasoning":"This item is conditional. The presence of fire escapes or emergency exit stairs serving as fire escapes triggers the requirement. Vision analysis found no such structures on the submitted plans, so this item may not be applicable.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations (4 pads identified)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pad locations but does not indicate which side of each pad is the access door. No dimension lines show clearance distances from the access door side to open areas or adjacent buildings. The 10-foot hot-stick use area clearance requirement cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision analysis found that transformer pads on Sheet 21 are shown as dashed rectangular outlines with no directional indicators, access door markers, or dimension lines showing clearances to open areas or structures.","reasoning":"Compliance with this requirement requires identifying which side of the transformer pad houses the access door, then verifying the 10-foot clearance in that direction. The submitted plans do not provide this information.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.11","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["transformer pad locations (only if in confined space such as niche, vault, or notched-out building area)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No cross-section drawings or elevation views showing whether any transformer pads are located in niches, vaults, or enclosed areas were provided. No documentation of 35-foot vertical clearance inside niche and niche entrance if applicable. Confined space configuration cannot be verified from submitted plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Plan-view sheets (Sheets 9, 21) do not depict vertical relationships. No cross-section or elevation sheets showing building profiles with transformer locations were identified in the plan set.","reasoning":"Determining whether a transformer faces a confined space requires cross-section analysis, which is not provided for any transformer pad location.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["fire hydrant locations on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan does not identify transformer pad locations relative to the fire hydrants shown. No dimension lines measure distances between transformer pads and fire hydrants. The 5-foot minimum clearance from fire hydrants cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) shows fire hydrant locations. Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pad locations. No dimension lines appear on either sheet measuring distances between these features. Vision analysis confirmed no callouts or notes relating fire hydrant clearances to transformer equipment.","reasoning":"Although both features are shown on respective plan sheets, the absence of dimensioned distances prevents verification of the 5-foot clearance requirement.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.16","status":"n/a","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":[],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan shows no dumpsters or waste collection enclosures on the property. This requirement is not applicable.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision analysis of Site Plan (Sheet 9) and cross-reference with Landscape Plan (Sheet 31) revealed no dumpster enclosures or waste containers shown anywhere on the site.","reasoning":"This item is conditional on the presence of dumpsters. Since no dumpsters are depicted on the plans, the requirement to maintain 5-foot clearance does not apply.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.17","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["parking and common areas (only if bike racks are present)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan and landscape plan show bicycle parking locations. No dimension lines show clearance distances from transformer pad locations to any bicycle parking areas. The 5-foot minimum clearance requirement cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 9 (Site Plan) and Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) both reference bicycle parking with callouts showing 'Bicycle Parking' symbols and counts. However, no dimension lines measure distances from transformer pads to these bicycle parking locations.","reasoning":"While bicycle racks are present on the site, the absence of dimensioned distances between transformer pads and bike racks prevents verification of the 5-foot clearance.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["site areas with light poles and transformer pads"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pad locations but does not clearly identify all light pole locations or show dimension lines measuring distances between light poles and transformer pads. The 5-foot minimum clearance from light poles cannot be verified from available evidence.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) focuses on electrical infrastructure (transformers, pull boxes, meters) but does not include lighting fixture callouts. Photometric or site lighting details were not located in the primary site plan sheets reviewed.","reasoning":"Without identification of light pole locations and dimensioned clearances, compliance cannot be verified.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.19","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["fire lanes"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":10}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fire Protection Plan shows fire lanes with dimensions, but no dimension lines measure distances from transformer pad locations to the fire lane boundaries. The 15-foot minimum clearance from fire lanes cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) shows fire lane boundaries labeled 'Fire Lane' with width dimensions (26', 24'). Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pads. Vision analysis found no dimension lines on either sheet connecting transformer pads to fire lane edges.","reasoning":"Although fire lanes are clearly marked and dimensioned on Sheet 10, the absence of dimensions showing distances from transformer pads prevents verification of the 15-foot clearance.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.20","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows four transformer pads, but no dimension lines measure distances between any pair of pads. The 5-foot minimum clearance between transformer pads cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Vision analysis of Sheet 21 confirmed four distinct transformer pads are labeled 'Electrical Transformer Pad' but no dimension lines appear between them.","reasoning":"With four transformer pads shown, verification of the 5-foot inter-pad clearance requires dimensioned evidence, which is not provided.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.21","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads and water lines on the site, but no dimension lines measure horizontal clearance distances from transformer pads to water lines. The 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance from water lines cannot be verified from available evidence.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) and Utility Tap Plan (Sheet 19) both show utility routing, but vision analysis confirmed no dimension lines on Sheet 21 measuring distances between transformer pads and water lines.","reasoning":"Compliance verification requires dimensioned clearances between transformer pads and water infrastructure, which are not provided.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.22","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":19}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads and wastewater lines on the site, but no dimension lines measure horizontal clearance distances from transformer pads to wastewater lines. The 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance from wastewater lines cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) and Utility Tap Plan (Sheet 19) show both transformer pads and wastewater routing, but vision analysis found no dimensioned clearances between these features.","reasoning":"Compliance requires documented horizontal separations between transformer pads and wastewater infrastructure, which are absent from submitted plans.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.23","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 2.9.1.B.2"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":12}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pad locations and Sheet 12 shows storm drain routing on the site, but no dimension lines measure horizontal clearance distances from transformer pads to storm drain lines. The 5-foot minimum horizontal clearance from storm drains cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pads. Storm Sewer Plan (Sheet 12) shows drainage infrastructure. Vision analysis found no dimension lines on electrical sheets measuring distances between transformer pads and storm drain lines.","reasoning":"Compliance requires documented horizontal separations between transformer pads and storm drainage, not provided in submitted evidence.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.A"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads and underground utility lines, but no dimension lines measure the 12-inch minimum horizontal and vertical clearance from transformer pads to other underground utilities. Compliance with UCM § 1.10.5.A separation requirements cannot be verified.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Electrical Plan (Sheet 21) shows transformer pads and the general routing of underground electric lines and other utilities, but vision analysis confirmed no dimension lines providing specific clearances between the transformer pads and adjacent underground infrastructure.","reasoning":"The 12-inch minimum separation (OD to OD) requires precise dimensioning that is not provided on the submitted plans.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.26","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.5.B"],"applicableAreas":["all transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads and underground utility routing. No cross-section drawings or elevation views confirm whether transformer pads or Austin Energy underground facilities are located over or under other utility lines, or whether customer structures are installed over AE underground facilities. Compliance cannot be verified from available evidence.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Plan-view sheets do not show vertical relationships between utilities. No cross-section or profile sheets for utility zones containing transformer pads were identified.","reasoning":"Verification of this requirement requires vertical section drawings showing utility layering at transformer pad locations, which are not provided.","tools_used":["vision"]}},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.27","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["areas with overhead electric distribution lines (none identified adjacent to transformer pads)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site plan shows overhead electric lines labeled 'OHE' along property boundaries, but no transformer pads appear to be located under or directly adjacent to these lines. No 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance dimension lines are shown. If transformer pads are positioned within the 7.5-foot clearance