4-foot threshold of parking cannot be definitively confirmed from the submitted plans.","agentTrace":{"observation":"Sheet 21 shows transformer pads in relation to internal driveways and parking areas. Transformer Pad 1 is near the main entrance driveway; Transformer Pad 5 appears near internal drive and parking island areas. Vision analysis estimated distances of approximately 5-10 feet from curb lines, but no explicit dimension callouts or measurement data confirm the exact distance from pad edge to parking/traffic boundary.","reasoning":"Verification requires: (1) explicit confirmation whether pads are within 4 feet of parking/traffic areas (currently uncertain from visual estimation), and (2) bollard specifications and placement details if applicable. Neither is provided in the submitted documents.","tools_used":["mcp__conductor_tools__vision"]}}]}}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ee23800-1891-4c6c-9860-87ab169d6f67","uuid":"bd1590bb-e1b3-4a72-bb83-088344d47bce"}
