formation**: READ for project identity, confirming the name (\"Valley View Townhomes\"), location (3759 Valley View Road, Austin, Texas 78704), and the owner entity (WM 41 Austin RE, LLC).\n    22→- **Blocks 1, 7: various — Landscape Architect Information**: READ for the contact information and branding for the landscape architecture firm responsible for the mitigation plan, BLU FISH Collaborative. \n    23→- **Blocks 2, 5, 6, 8, 12, 13: various — Boilerplate & Administrative**: READ for sheet metadata, including the drawing title (\"TREE LIST\"), project number (010-25-01), sheet sequence (29 of 35), and the professional seal with the issue date of 02/13/2026.\n    24→\n    25→---\n    26→\n    27→- `block-3.md` — table: Table detailing surveyed trees, required protection, removed trees, and required tree mitigation.\n    28→\n    29→All other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n    30→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed658f06-b65b-479d-b752-f47b92243df6","uuid":"86ce40fc-3100-4048-87e8-88988be82cf6","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/vercel/sandbox/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/primary-site-plan/sheet-32/guide.md","content":"# Sheet 32 — Tree List\n\nThis page provides a detailed list of surveyed trees.\n\n## Reading Guide\n\nThis sheet contains the comprehensive Tree List for the Valley View Townhomes project. Its primary purpose is to inventory all surveyed trees on the site, detail their current condition, specify whether they will remain or be removed, and calculate the total required tree protection and tree mitigation in inches based on local codes.\n\n**Key values**:\n- Total Required Tree Protection: 672.00 inches\n- Total Removed Trees: 306.00 inches\n- Total Required Tree Mitigation: 217.00 inches\n- Total Surveyed Heritage Trees (24\" & UP): 212 inches\n- Total Surveyed ECM Appendix F Trees (19\" - 23.9\"): 99 inches\n- Total Surveyed ECM Appendix F Trees (8\" - 18.9\"): 295 inches\n- Tree Survey Date: 03/28/2025\n\n**Content blocks on this sheet**:\n- **Block 3: table — Tree Survey and Mitigation Table**: This is the primary data source on the sheet. READ the block content for the line-item details of every tree, including its tag number, diameter in inches, species, arborist-assessed condition, and mitigation status. Read the far-right and bottom rows for the exact calculations of required tree protection inches, removal inches, and mitigation inches categorized by tree type (Heritage, Non-Heritage, Appendix F, etc.).\n- **Block 10: text_block — Survey Note**: READ the block content to confirm the source of the foundational tree data (Sinclair Land Surveying, Inc.) and the date the survey was completed (03/28/2025).\n- **Blocks 4, 9, 11: text_blocks — Project Information**: READ for project identity, confirming the name (\"Valley View Townhomes\"), location (3759 Valley View Road, Austin, Texas 78704), and the owner entity (WM 41 Austin RE, LLC).\n- **Blocks 1, 7: various — Landscape Architect Information**: READ for the contact information and branding for the landscape architecture firm responsible for the mitigation plan, BLU FISH Collaborative. \n- **Blocks 2, 5, 6, 8, 12, 13: various — Boilerplate & Administrative**: READ for sheet metadata, including the drawing title (\"TREE LIST\"), project number (010-25-01), sheet sequence (29 of 35), and the professional seal with the issue date of 02/13/2026.\n\n---\n\n- `block-3.md` — table: Table detailing surveyed trees, required protection, removed trees, and required tree mitigation.\n\nAll other block detail in `./blocks.md`\n","numLines":30,"startLine":1,"totalLines":30}