ocated at the northern property corner. Water and wastewater connections will serve all eight buildings.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Figure: Professional Engineer Seal of Jason K. Rodgers, License 87881, State of Texas, with signature overlay]\n\nJason Rodgers\nProject Manager\nBleyl Engineering\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
