shold for large tree prohibitions.\n\n### **Evaluation Results**\n\n**Fail Items: 2**\n- **EL-2.14:** Trees not shown with sufficient clearance dimensions to verify compliance\n- **EL-2.15:** No documented Austin Energy written approval for trees in restricted clearance zones\n\n**Not-Verifiable Items: 6**\n- **EL-2.1:** Utility-compatible status not designated for proposed trees\n- **EL-2.3:** Mature heights per ECM Appendix F not documented to verify large tree restrictions\n- **EL-2.6:** Clearance dimensions to utility poles not provided\n- **EL-2.7:** Clearance dimensions to pad-mounted equipment not provided\n- **EL-2.8:** Underground equipment locations not identified on landscape plan\n- **EL-2.9:** Root barrier specifications for trees near underground equipment not provided\n- **EL-2.11:** Large trees (40+ feet) not differentiated on plans\n\n**Pass Items: 1**\n- **EL-2.10:** Plant species are properly identified on the plant schedule\n\n**N/A Items: 5**\n- **EL-2.2, EL-2.4:** No transmission lines present (distribution infrastructure only)\n- **EL-2.5:** No transmission easement boundaries identified\n- **EL-2.12, EL-2.13:** No clearances dimensioned on plans (requirement only applies when clearances are shown)\n\nThe structured findings have been provided with specific citations, sheet references, and detailed explanations of each deficiency.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ed658f06-b65b-479d-b752-f47b92243df6","total_cost_usd":0.2661902,"usage":{"input_tokens":7273,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54048,"cache_read_input_tokens":952072,"output_tokens":19230,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":54048},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7273,"outputTokens":19230,"cacheReadInputTokens":952072,"cacheCreationInputTokens":54048,"webSearchRequests":0,